      ],
      "title": "Why it's bad",
      "gist": "Because writing is thinking, a world of write-nots will be a world of think-nots, like strength after preindustrial work — only those who choose it will have it."
    },
    "n0020": {
      "id": "n0020",
      "depth": 2,
